• Strong experience (5+ years) building and operating production backend services at scale. &nbsp;

• Expertise in Python, with a track record of designing and shipping production-quality services and tools. &nbsp;

• Strong proficiency with SQL for querying, transforming, and analyzing relational and analytical data. &nbsp;

